<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka end flat against dollar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka end flat against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bangladesh taka closed flat 43.7600/7700 to the dollar in interbank trading ahead of Friday weekend, dealers said.</p>
<p>The local unit was quoted weaker and at wide range at 43.7700/8100 per dollar in early trade but deals were mostly done at 43.7650 level.</p>
<p>Call money was traded at 7.5 to 9.0 percent against previous at 7.5-8.5 percent.</p>
<p>Banks in Bangladesh close transactions by midday on Thursday.</p>
<p>- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
